{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-07_end",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-07",
  "title": "不虞之会",
  "storyCode": "13-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1b40e41d1337464fed0645396f3fd34fbfa12bf0c0559bf773e9af429d5229b9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的萨卡兹劳工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "厄尔苏拉，卸货已经完成了，正在清点入库。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的萨卡兹劳工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还是和以前一样，钢材、赤金、源石之类的。已经有大半个月没有人员的运输了，估计是卡兹戴尔那边的王庭军基本都已经过来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的萨卡兹劳工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还是卸这些东西省事，以前那些王庭军的成员，在舱室里漂得七荤八素，每次下来就要发一通脾气，麻烦得要死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "停。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到此为止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的萨卡兹劳工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，抱歉抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的萨卡兹劳工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有个事，长官，我在停靠站已经服役了半年了，按照轮班表，我也差不多该——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我没有收到有关你的任何调度命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不过，你的工作成果有目共睹。我可以批你三天的假期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欢呼的萨卡兹劳工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦♪我们的厄尔苏拉♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，老实待在山里，别再和我说什么建功立业的疯话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你从小到大都在卡兹戴尔修鞋，最大的本事就是给人钉鞋掌，除非把自己炸了，否则你是谁的对手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欢呼的萨卡兹劳工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "厄尔苏拉♪你真无趣♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "滚吧，小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窃笑的萨卡兹劳工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小声）喂，兄弟，揣好了，厄尔苏拉一天没这东西都不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窃笑的萨卡兹劳工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小声）你可真有本事，身边已经跟了一个了，还——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "管好你的嘴巴，鞋匠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逃离的萨卡兹劳工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是什么甜美如蜜糖♪是什么危险如砒霜♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要是敢现在打开你的本子，我就把它烧了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们还和以前一样，挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们有些年没见了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "自从那次行动之后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我，赫德雷和W......上一个W，惹了些不该惹的麻烦，杀了些不该杀的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了疤痕商场，你们在卡兹戴尔露面也成了件麻烦的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在那里可经常看见你们的名字......在悬赏榜单上，赫赫有名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一向很值钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "确实。伊内丝的投资很成功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那时我们都很年轻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "服老了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是萨卡兹，你是羊，按理说我可比你活得长，伊内丝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大家都是感染者，我们比的可不是种族寿命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说得好，我该敬你一杯，也祝我自己健康。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我记得你以前总说，萨卡兹想要活得长，得保持一颗清醒的脑袋，否则它就会稀里糊涂被别人取走换钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁要就拿去吧，维多利亚人，萨卡兹，我不在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伊内丝，你长皱纹了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我死了三次，代价仅仅是长了点皱纹，我该感谢众魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你谢不着众魂，你是羊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至于赫德雷，你瞎了只眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想看看我空空的眼眶吗？拜这位卡普里尼女士所赐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "丢一只眼睛，或者丢一个脑袋，你有的选。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我猜伊内丝下手的时候伤心坏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老友见面，我们就不能回到一种感伤又唏嘘的氛围里吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谈谈岁月，谈谈时间......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也谈谈你什么时候变成了军事委员会最年轻的少校，这只骸骨巨兽的驾驶员，厄尔苏拉指挥官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是啊。我们确实该谈谈这些。不然以我们的身份，不该这么温情脉脉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "也不妨谈谈你们，两个萨卡兹的......\n一个萨卡兹的叛徒，和一只羊，为什么会出现在军事委员会的绝密地点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道你被曼弗雷德将军逮捕了，赫德雷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然后，你和破坏了我们军事行动的伊内丝，还有一个在外面埋炸弹的丫头，在白天潜入了我的辖区。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "作为军事委员会的在职军官，我没有任何立场容忍这件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我们二对一，厄尔苏拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "二对一？看清楚你们在哪里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你大可以试试，伊内丝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些年我学会的最重要的事，就是忠于自己所选择的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的选择，就是特雷西斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，是军事委员会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们选择跟着巴别塔——现在叫什么？罗德岛？而我选择与军事委员会站在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们早就为自己选好路了，二位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "厄尔苏拉，我们可以再——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我拒绝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我很清楚你想的是什么，赫德雷，你一点也没变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是我们已经不再是揣着刚挣来的赏金就能高兴一整天的少年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们已经没有可能在任务的间隙，于卡兹戴尔的街头虚耗掉一个又一个下午了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们是萨卡兹......起码都是卡兹戴尔的市民。让我们的街巷变得更好，这是我们天生的责任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们就是在讨论卡兹戴尔的问题，厄尔苏拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么你们就必须承认，军事委员会是我们至今为止最好的选择！连特蕾西娅殿下都没有否认过这一点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是两位殿下把卡兹戴尔搬上了移动城市，是两位殿下让我们有可能在这里继续谈论萨卡兹的未来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也是两位殿下拔擢了我，让贫民窟出身的穷姑娘也有机会和血脉古老而纯粹的王庭成员们注视着同一张沙盘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一旦被天真的观念和折中的想法困住，萨卡兹将失去他们离真正的“家园”最近的一次机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不认为我有任何需要犹豫的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "军事委员会才是......“卡兹戴尔”能够成为一个“国家”的底盘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那战火之后，这片大地上还会有卡兹戴尔的存在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只知道自己不能当这个叛徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "十分钟，我最多坚持这么久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尽量多带些有关那东西的情报回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些贯穿了脊椎的“钉子”，应该是某种巫术操纵装置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这附近的神经束在不停颤抖，它还有自我意志吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "脊椎守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她在这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，军事素养很强，厄尔苏拉确实训练出了一支精锐的部队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但缺乏变通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了人多，你们也没什么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......它对自己真够狠的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就在前面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳，呸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到处都是灰......风化的骨粉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里应该就是中枢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，没有任何可以理解的接口，纯粹由巫术驱动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它到底是心甘情愿的奴隶，还是提线木偶式的空壳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你还是避开了我的源石技艺，伊内丝，你本该被洞穿心脏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也还是没能纠正自己的老习惯，法术的轨迹会向左偏斜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我庆幸自己曾经吃了很多次亏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你很匆忙吗？赫德雷让你难堪了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它很脆弱，对吧？它没它表现出来的那么老实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你大可以尽情猜测。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......如果有机会的话，我真想好好听你聊聊那“三次死亡”，绝对是些刺激的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你想再添一次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，先活着吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你能在乱流中......活下来的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "给自己留点体面，伊内丝，这没用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的影子无法在这只巨兽的能力下保护你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感谢提醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫德雷——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们早就过了谈友情的年纪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是我宁愿未来生活在卡兹戴尔的人，保持那份我们所一直嘲笑的，“愚蠢的天真”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "忘了告诉你，赫德雷，曼弗雷德将军给我带来过你的书。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很不错，我承认，很不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你精心拣选了一段段碎片，按时间顺序把它们排布其中，你以为你寻到了脉络。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可你一直在逃。你打算一直这样吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行了，厄尔苏拉，说再见吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫德雷，这次你得和我一起跳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别被历史的乱流卷住，别为了捡拾历史的碎片而忘了......眼前的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
